    kind: work_item  # 6fa2
    title: "INV-nular remainder sweep: probe-first candidate pool over every rowed name, parallel source-citing sub-agent review with blind plants, verifier; output a candidate list, not catalogue edits"  # 6fa2
    status: todo_hard  # 6fa2
    priority: 2  # 6fa2
